diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..58fe893 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,43 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers the browser push subscription the push service handed to the browser, so pushes for new notifications can be delivered to that device. Only the current user can register a subscription for themselves.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The URL of the push service endpoint the browser subscribed to |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The `p256dh` public key from the subscription's keys |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The `auth` secret from the subscription's keys |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/abc123",
+    "p256dh_key": "BDh...",
+    "auth_key": "Ab1..."
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2",
+  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/abc123",
+  "p256dh_key": "BDh...",
+  "auth_key": "Ab1...",
+  "user_agent": "Mozilla/5.0",
+  "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:03:58.000Z",
+  "updated_at": "2025-11-19T04:03:58.000Z"
+}
+```
+
+Registering the same endpoint again refreshes the keys of that device's subscription.
+
+Pushes are signed with the instance's VAPID keys, `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY`. Each push carries the title and body the notifications list shows and the path of the card it's about.
